# graphify's graph is committed to git (see .gitignore) but excluded here -
# it's meant to be QUERIED (graphify query "...") not read as raw context.
# Without this, every graphify extract/update re-uploads the whole graph
# file as context on the next turn, invalidating Claude Code's prompt
# cache - the exact token cost graphify is supposed to avoid.
graph.json
graphify-out/
